scripts/_*.html
scripts/_*.py

# Raw export of the internal "Uzio Implementation Onboarding Tracker" sheet.
# Deliberately NOT committed: this repository is public, and the export carries
# internal client notes plus personal contact details (private email addresses
# and a phone number) that appear in some DSP Name cells.
# Regenerate it locally with scripts/decode_dsp_sheet.py when needed.
data/shruti_dsp_implementation.csv

# Per-employee export from the Envers audit trail — real full names and employee
# IDs for a named client. Same reason as above: this repository is public.
# Regenerate it locally with scripts/export_55th3rd_id_changes.py when needed.
data/55th-3rd-employee-id-changes.csv

# The 164 Stave Delivery employees who ended the document upload with nothing
# against their profile — names, hire and termination dates. Third time for the
# same reason: this repository is public. The script that writes it is committed,
# the output is not. Regenerate locally with scripts/add_stave_zero_doc_employees.py.
data/stave_zero_doc_employees.csv
